# Exported artefacts. An HTML report or rule-catalog workbook carries real account
# IDs, resource IDs, IPs and CIDRs unless redact mode was on when it was produced,
# and nothing in .github-sync-exclude covers *.html or *.xlsx — so one stray
# `git add -A` would push a customer's estate to GitLab and the next promotion
# would publish it to the PUBLIC GitHub mirror.
dx-resilience-*.html
NWRA-Rule-Catalog-*.xlsx
# Excel's lock file for an open workbook.
~$*.xlsx

# Local-only working directories. Anchored with a leading slash: a bare `scripts/`
# also matches the TRACKED dx-visualizer/skills/nwra-skill/skill/scripts/, which
# would quietly ignore new files in the vendored skill bundle.
/.worktrees/
/scripts/
